cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Analysis code and data for "A Difference-in-Differences Study on the Impact of
  the Affordable Care Act on Insurance Coverage and Healthcare Utilization Among
  Patients with Sickle Cell Disease"
message: >-
  If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using the metadata below,
  and also cite the CDC Sickle Cell Data Collection program as the original data
  source.
type: software
authors:
