repository-code: 'https://github.com/USERNAME/scd-aca-did'
abstract: >-
  Interrupted time series analysis with difference-in-differences estimation of
  the effect of the Affordable Care Act on insurance coverage and acute care
  utilization among patients with sickle cell disease, comparing California
  (Medicaid expansion) with Georgia (non-expansion), 2010-2018, using publicly
  available CDC Sickle Cell Data Collection program data.
keywords:
  - sickle cell disease
  - Affordable Care Act
  - Medicaid expansion
  - difference-in-differences
  - interrupted time series
  - health services research
  - health policy
